WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.967
Why AI reshapes test automation.

2
00:00:03.267 --> 00:00:06.265
Classic automation has three chronic problems.

3
00:00:06.265 --> 00:00:07.633
AI attacks all three.

4
00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:10.767
Here are the three chronic problems.

5
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:13.602
Locators break on every redesign.

6
00:00:13.602 --> 00:00:18.367
AI finds elements by meaning, instead of brittle CSS or XPath.

7
00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:21.034
Scripts need a rewrite each release.

8
00:00:21.034 --> 00:00:23.533
AI can generate test cases from specs.

9
00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:27.265
And coverage plateaus, because writing cases is slow.

10
00:00:27.265 --> 00:00:30.567
AI can explore an app the way a human tester would.

11
00:00:31.767 --> 00:00:33.533
It helps to think in three tiers.

12
00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.398
Tier one is authoring.

13
00:00:35.398 --> 00:00:40.733
An LLM drafts cases or scripts from a spec, and a human or CI reviews them.

14
00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:42.690
Tier two is maintenance.

15
00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:46.833
Locators and visual checks use AI signals to survive change.

16
00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:49.526
Tier three is autonomous execution.

17
00:00:49.526 --> 00:00:53.900
An agent perceives, plans, and acts against a live app each run.

18
00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.128
Tiers one and two share a pattern.

19
00:00:57.128 --> 00:01:01.600
The AI helps write or repair a script, and then the script runs on its own.

20
00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:03.364
Tier three is different.

21
00:01:03.364 --> 00:01:08.000
There is no script, because the agent itself decides what to do at run time.

22
00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.733
Now the critical distinction.

23
00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:17.400
With AI assisted automation, AI writes or heals a script, which then runs deterministically.

24
00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.667
It runs the same way every time.

25
00:01:19.967 --> 00:01:24.037
With AI autonomous testing, an agent decides actions live.

26
00:01:24.037 --> 00:01:29.300
It adapts and finds the unexpected, but it is slower and non-deterministic.

27
00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.400
Production suites lean on assisted for regression.

28
00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:37.467
The tempting mistake is replacing the regression suite with an agent.

29
00:01:37.767 --> 00:01:44.600
Instead, the autonomous agent is a discovery tool, and it complements the regression suite rather than replacing it.

30
00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:46.658
Let's recap.

31
00:01:46.658 --> 00:01:49.233
AI locates, generates, and explores.

32
00:01:49.533 --> 00:01:52.767
There are three tiers: authoring, maintenance, and autonomy.

33
00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:55.600
Assisted automation stays deterministic.

34
00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:58.561
Autonomous testing is for discovery.

35
00:01:58.561 --> 00:02:01.000
Next up: AI generated test cases.
